processing.body:
In this relationship the club is the controller and Poolse is the processor. Poolse undertakes to:

- process the data only to provide the service and on the club's instructions;
- ensure that anyone with access to the data is bound by confidentiality;
- apply the security measures described in the privacy policy;
- use only the processors listed in the privacy policy, and tell the club before adding another;
- help the club answer people's requests about their data;
- tell the club without undue delay if a data breach occurs;
- at the end of the service, allow export and delete the data within the periods in the privacy policy;
- make available the information needed to show these obligations are met.
